Spec: Android target identity pin

Purpose:
  Match an explicitly trusted component and complete current signer set to a stable package snapshot.

Owns:
  ./PeerPin.java

Must:
  Require exact current SHA-256 signer set equality, canonical component names and enabled exported service state.
  Reject shared UID and changes to UID, first-install time, update time or signer set during a binding.
  Copy signer collections and return fixed errors without package or certificate reflection.
